{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four stories. Thousands of raw wounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>R/A\\W</strong> is a collection of anti-war visual novels developed over the past three years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NO WAY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sasha drives home along the country roads, pacing from stop to stop, as she calls on Agnia, who is... not doing well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It's going to be a small and personal story, as if out of our world, isn't it?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE BEAST</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The story of two ordinary guys trapped in a war, facing a difficult choice: inevitable doom tomorrow or the shame of desertion today.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NEW ANGEL SANCTUARY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Shenetz returns to his once abandoned homeland and meets a girl who has defeated Death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What happened to her and the place over the years?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>FAREWELL TO DERE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Fog, which sows anger and hatred, covers the City, but no one but the protagonist notices it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To stop the Fog, he sacrifices everything.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"No Way!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3445290/4e283ae7e8795002d3966f093c3af3ff20183927.jpg"},{"name":"The Beast","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3445290/46e0cb57cf92422473f4abcf07f440ba0e33d91e.jpg"},{"name":"Liguri","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3445290/52f03d0d6f91cdab23bf35fbd6b229980b867cd9.jpg"},{"name":"Tokine","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3445290/46934b48230b4e0e5f62d373284e97d7273915d7.jpg"},{"name":"Farewell To DERE","path":"https://cdn.a